            "sid": "JER 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Dano giwacci kabedo man obedo calo tim aroo; dano kadi ki lee ma bedo iye pe. Obedo lok ada ni gaŋi me Juda ki yo me Jerucalem gitye noŋo; dano nyo lee mo pe ma bedo kunnu. Ento i kabedo magi doki wubiwinyo aye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
