            "verseId": "JER.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco ki Jeremia ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bedo tek me turo gicikkena ki ceŋ ki dyewor, wek pe omi ceŋ ki dyewor gubin i karegi ma mitte kikome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno bene bedo tek me turo gicikkena ki laticca Daudi, wek pe en obed ki lakware mo ma myero obed kabaka, ki dok bene me turo gicikkena ki ajwagi ma gua ki i kaka pa Levi ma gin aye gitye ka tic bota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimedo wei likwayo pa laticca Daudi ki wel ajwagi bene ma gua ki i kaka pa Levi ma gitiyo bota, wek bene kwanogi obed tek kit macalo kwano lakalatwe ma i polo nyo nyig kweyo me dog nam tek kwede.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
